      "content": "i hear you, but isnt it kind of unfair to say the benefits were just \"theoretical\"? some economists say free trade is objectively better for long term growth which eventually helps everyone through more innovation and cheaper goods. dont u think that's a pretty valid way to look at it, or is that just a corporate talking point?",
